    "engine": "plan",
    "source": "THROAT r2 (2026-10-16_r2/Screens, FreeCAD see-through 400 mm blocks A-D + BLANK): the FRONT heightfield of each block (z-buffer of its STL; openings drawn as recesses to the back plane, 80 mm). The lay uses A turned round about the vertical axis (A.F, its back face to the front); a cast tile has a flat back and cannot be mirrored, so it is baked as its own mould AF (5th face). scr2_layouts.THROAT_LEVELS / throat_cell rule stretched over 22 x 7 modules (8.8 x 2.8 m: the 9 x 2.8 m gallery field in whole 400 mm modules), gallery plan; any other wall size re-applies the throat_cell rule over it (resize: rule). Stand-in: WIP.",
